Apache log4php Changelog
========================

ForGoodTech 2.3.1
-----------------

* Added a supported PHP 8.2-8.5 compatibility matrix.
* Replaced the removed each() function used while applying configuration.
* Added support for logging all Throwable instances, including PHP Error.
* Removed implicit float-to-integer timestamp conversions in date formatting.
* Made the base layout's header and footer honor their documented string type.
* Declared nullable typed parameters explicitly for PHP 8.4 and newer.
* Normalized SimpleXML attribute values to native strings for PHP 8.5.
* Added Composer-autoload, XML-configuration, daily-file, and throwable smoke
  tests.

Please refer to src/changes/changes.xml for the latest changes.

Changes for stable versions may be found online at: 
http://logging.apache.org/log4php/changelog.html
